
============================================================================================
EXPLORATORY FIREWALL: no kill conditions exist for this observable; nothing here
can support or kill the framework. First exploratory number; creates the baseline;
pre-registers full-Jeans Stage 2. THE PROXY IS NOT beta. (FROZEN.md sec.3/5)
============================================================================================

merged resolved subsample: 48 galaxies (all cut_primary=1; frozen N target 48)
controls held: log10 M*, log10 Re(kpc), z (frozen; + log10 sigma_e in bracket B).
ENVIRONMENT control: OMITTED -- no public group catalog crossmatched at firing
time (FROZEN.md sec.4 permits omission if stated; Stage 2 should add one, e.g.
Tempel+ 2017 SDSS groups).

pre-registered confounder check: corr(P2, log sigma_e) = -0.616 (a sigma-correlated proxy is the channel by which a sigma-dependent IMF can FAKE
a slope; hence the mandatory bracket-B rerun below).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
